"text": "This look is built for a crisp, professional morning on the street. You are wearing the dark grey kimono-style coat to keep you warm against the frost and snow while you walk to the office; it sits beautifully with your black t-shirt and khaki tenسيل trousers, creating a silhouette that feels both sophisticated and comfortable in freezing weather. The outfit is finished with delicate gold-and-silver details on the jewelry and headwear, which catch the light without being loud, and the ginger suede ankle boots add warmth and texture to complete this winter-friendly ensemble.",
