"about_items": [
{
"n": "#119·38",
"text": "This dark grey kimono-style coat features a soft, textured fabric and a relaxed fit with long sleeves that are slightly gathered at the cuffs. It is designed to be worn open or belted to define your waistline."
},
{
"n": "#453·13",
"text": "Your black t-shirt has a simple crew neck and short, fitted sleeves that sit smoothly against the shoulders. This understated top acts as a perfect base for your outfit."
},
{
"n": "#170·26",
"text": "These khaki tenسيل trousers feature a relaxed but straight cut that flows comfortably from the waist to the ankle. The fabric has a soft drape and subtle sheen that looks elegant when paired with the coat above."
},
{
"n": "#151·16",
"text": "This black beret is made of smooth fabric with structured sides and a rounded crown. It features an array of sparkling gold and clear embellishments, including large faceted crystals and small metallic studs, that add a touch of glamour."
},
{
"n": "#543·16",
"text": "This milky-colored hair cuff has a soft, fabric-covered band shaped into a semi-circle. It is decorated with delicate silver-toned floral appliqués featuring gold centers and scattered clear gemstones that catch the light."
},
{
"n": "#261·05",
"text": "Your ginger ankle boots are crafted from soft suede material with a rounded toe and a comfortable low block heel. They feature lacing up the front, a classic leather-style sole, and cozy shearling lining visible at the collar for extra warmth."
}
],
